2. External backends (invoked as separate processes)
----------------------------------------------------

None are bundled yet. Planned (Phase 1 evaluates them). tools/backends/build.sh
builds the pinned versions with all their dependencies linked statically; each
archive carries a licenses/ folder with the copyright file of every library
linked in:

COLMAP 4.2.1    BSD-3-Clause        https://github.com/colmap/colmap
OpenMVS v2.4.0  AGPL-3.0            https://github.com/cdcseacave/openMVS
                (depends on CGAL, parts of which are GPL-3.0+)
Brush           Apache-2.0          https://github.com/ArthurBrussee/brush
FFmpeg          LGPL-2.1+ or GPL-2.0+ depending on build configuration
                                    https://ffmpeg.org/


